00:22:12.100 --> 00:22:26.580
If you look at like what, uh, developers other than Nintendo have been doing with, uh, Freedom Force or Gotcha or, um, Operation Wolf, like they were kind of going into the, uh, the light gun territory.

00:22:26.900 --> 00:22:32.560
Uh, even though I don't think that genre was fully established at this point, uh, like early prototypes of it.

00:22:32.560 --> 00:22:40.460
Whereas this is truly just going back to the arcade experience of Hogan's Alley and, uh, Duck Hunt and Wild Gunman.

00:22:40.960 --> 00:22:47.040
