00:27:04.480 --> 00:27:11.540
Uh, there's some other gimmicky things, but to take it to like the next level, no, I don't think that there's anything I could think of.

00:27:11.640 --> 00:27:26.120
There's different genres they could have approached, but I think the Zapper, just by having, uh, Duck Hunt and, uh, trying things like Operation Wolf and stuff like that, like just, just having those things on the system validates the Zapper's existence.

00:27:26.120 --> 00:27:35.780
