00:27:38.640 --> 00:27:43.900
All right. Uh, it's not even just the amount of mini games or that they all are essentially shooting galleries.

00:27:44.320 --> 00:27:52.680
I think that when you just continue to say that, oh, what changes is it gets things fall faster or move faster or move more radically.

00:27:52.680 --> 00:27:56.340
Like I feel like go to the balloon saloon for a second.

00:27:56.360 --> 00:28:07.020
