00:28:28.460 --> 00:28:40.040
Like if the stages actually evolved a little with it, I think that this could have, uh, been like, oh yeah, this is what we're able to do five years later in 1990 when we've had some time to think about it.

00:28:40.040 --> 00:28:55.320
But ultimately they didn't really think about anything and they kind of just said like, well, we can release, uh, more arcadey, you know, simple shootery stuff for people who are kind of looking for that because we have a action, uh, console set that we need to kind of justify.

