Right. Anyway, uh, also just real fast before I go to Joe, uh, the point was that Duck Hunt was five years ago.

00:30:32.280 --> 00:30:36.160
So I wasn't expecting it to do it then, but I was kind of hoping that they would do something now.

00:30:36.420 --> 00:30:37.460
