00:30:51.600 --> 00:30:54.420
But the modes just feel kind of lackluster.

00:30:54.420 --> 00:31:03.440
And, and Duck Hunt, they're simple, but I, I feel like I can play, I can play the Duck Hunt level forever because I am really trying to up my score.

00:31:03.620 --> 00:31:08.220
And I do feel the difficulty spike as it goes, like, a lot more in Duck Hunt.

00:31:08.540 --> 00:31:10.480
Um, and same thing with the clay pigeons.

00:31:10.820 --> 00:31:13.120
Uh, Barker Bill, it was fun.

00:31:13.340 --> 00:31:19.000
But, uh, you know, outside of the, the, uh, glass pane mode, which did bore me a lot.

00:31:19.000 --> 00:31:22.440
The other, the other modes were fine, but I did kind of get tired of them after a while too.

00:31:22.600 --> 00:31:28.920
And one of you mentioned that, uh, that the, when, when, when the dog says next round, you're hoping for something new.

00:31:29.000 --> 00:31:34.180
