00:31:34.580 --> 00:31:38.380
Like, the only way for it to be over is by doing poorly, which then lowers your score.

00:31:38.540 --> 00:31:39.420
So that was weird too.

00:31:39.560 --> 00:31:41.960
But anyway, overall, I will say not essential.

00:31:41.960 --> 00:31:49.040
But I do think that there were, there is and has been potential for, like, the Zapper to evolve in ways that aren't just gimmicky.

00:31:49.440 --> 00:31:56.820
And when I bust out the, uh, the Zapper for this game, I did also, uh, revisit To the Earth.

00:31:57.020 --> 00:32:01.120
And, man, I love that game and I'm so upset with myself that I didn't vote essential originally.

00:32:01.120 --> 00:32:07.260
I, I will definitely be, uh, making a, uh, a plea for, for that in the, the best of this year.

00:32:07.260 --> 00:32:12.380
